WEBVTT

00:00:01.210 --> 00:00:03.810
Operation Jinx is proceeding on schedule.

00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:08.320
In all areas of the country, anti-Thanatos response is improving.

00:00:09.280 --> 00:00:11.570
The mass production line will be online shortly.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.810
Director Yorgo, is something worrying you?

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.980
Nothing's been left to chance.

00:00:24.480 --> 00:00:27.860
I'm counting on you, Elenfriet.

00:00:28.440 --> 00:00:29.440
Yes, sir!

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:40.960
They're taking longer and longer to neutralize the Thanatos threat.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.030
Phase 10: Time's Rondo

00:02:23.350 --> 00:02:24.470
Nyx...

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:27.350
Good morning.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:29.260
Oh my, Angelique.

00:02:29.480 --> 00:02:30.850
Good morning.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.740
What are you doing?

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:35.400
I'm tending to the flowerbed.

00:02:36.020 --> 00:02:38.590
I decided to sow some new seeds.

00:02:40.370 --> 00:02:41.550
The flowerbed?

00:02:42.730 --> 00:02:45.150
It doesn't really look like a flowerbed, does it?

00:02:45.510 --> 00:02:48.380
No, I'm sorry...

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:56.840
Don't worry about it. Actually, I've planted lots of seeds before, but they always wilt before they bloom.

00:02:58.290 --> 00:02:59.760
I wonder why...

00:02:59.890 --> 00:03:01.040
I don't know.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.970
It's as if my hands absorb their life.

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:09.860
I'll help you.

00:03:10.150 --> 00:03:14.580
I'm sure the flowers will respond to your feelings one day!

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:21.600
If I see that smile of yours, planting these flowers won't feel like a chore.

00:03:23.340 --> 00:03:25.310
You love flowers, don't you?

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:26.360
Love?

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:28.980
I suppose I do.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:31.520
Maybe I want to be like them.

00:03:31.570 --> 00:03:32.740
Like them?

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:38.890
Yes. They're strong, yet bring hope and tranquility to any who see them.

00:03:39.010 --> 00:03:41.880
Their presence is holy and divine, isn't it?

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:43.270
Yes!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:57.960
It's no good.

00:03:58.040 --> 00:03:59.790
There's nothing left.

00:03:59.910 --> 00:04:00.930
What is this?

00:04:01.960 --> 00:04:03.060
The Jinx?

00:04:03.100 --> 00:04:03.900
Yeah.

00:04:03.970 --> 00:04:04.980
It's horrible.

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:07.080
Don't say that.

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:10.310
We're all still alive.

00:04:10.380 --> 00:04:12.280
Why did this happen?

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:16.070
That Jinx had a hard time.

00:04:16.620 --> 00:04:17.740
A hard time?

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:23.890
That Thanatos appeared and the Foundation arrived straight away, but...

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:33.610
It looked like their attacks weren't really working.

00:04:34.760 --> 00:04:38.090
By the time they'd managed to beat them, the place ended up like this.

00:04:38.180 --> 00:04:41.930
The attacks hit but they weren't able to defeat them straight away?

00:04:42.140 --> 00:04:44.040
Is that what you're saying?

00:04:45.670 --> 00:04:52.000
The first time we saw the Jinx, it destroyed a Thanatos in an instant.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:05.260
What's going on?

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:11.790
What do you mean?

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:15.140
I've told you already; I can't help you.

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:19.470
The Jinx has never caused this much damage to its surroundings before.

00:05:19.740 --> 00:05:22.100
They barely managed to defeat the Thanatos, didn't they?

00:05:23.190 --> 00:05:26.450
You love this village, don't you?

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:30.330
If you love it, then why don't you raise your voice in protest?

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:35.000
I can't say anything <i>because</i> I love it.

00:05:37.710 --> 00:05:40.280
What happened here?

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:42.090
Bernal?

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:44.980
I've found out what happened.

00:05:44.420 --> 00:05:45.460
What?

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:48.250
This one's gonna make me some serious money.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:51.260
Listen to me, man.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:54.980
During the fight in the village, a Jinx was destroyed by a Thanatos!

00:05:55.320 --> 00:05:56.780
Destroyed?

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:58.750
Did you hear that from the villagers?

00:05:58.820 --> 00:06:01.300
Had a hell of a time getting them to tell me, but yeah.

00:06:01.580 --> 00:06:06.800
Sounds like the Foundation promised to rebuild the village as long as they stayed quiet about it.

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:09.450
The Jinx's attacks didn't work.

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:14.920
And they kept attacking until they were destroyed, and they took the village with them.

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.230
What happened to the Thanatos?

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:19.900
The Knights of the Silver Tree arrived just in time to defeat them.

00:06:22.250 --> 00:06:24.950
The Jinx have been having a hard time lately.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.140
And here, they've finally lost!

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:28.810
What do you think about this?

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:32.780
Has something happened that they didn't anticipate?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:39.850
Nyx didn't look so good...

00:06:42.890 --> 00:06:46.670
Erwin, do you think Nyx will be happy?

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.040
This song...

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:08.030
I can't deny my desires any longer...

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:30.040
Angelique...

00:07:30.250 --> 00:07:34.880
Um, I'm sorry I barged in without asking...

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:36.530
I made some tea.

00:07:36.620 --> 00:07:37.980
Would you like some?

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:42.740
Oh, thank you.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:50.190
I'm afraid you caught me at an embarrassing moment.

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.060
Not at all!

00:07:54.140 --> 00:07:55.190
Here you are.

00:07:55.250 --> 00:07:56.820
Thank you.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.130
This is...

00:07:59.900 --> 00:08:03.050
The postman gave it to me.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:08.550
It's a lovely envelope, isn't it?

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:10.760
It's an invitation to a ball.

00:08:10.860 --> 00:08:12.020
A ball?

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:15.210
Yes, I don't intend to go, but...

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:21.000
He really doesn't look well.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:28.160
Maybe a change of pace would help...

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:35.440
Nyx, if you don't mind too much, would you take me to the ball?

00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:37.860
I'd like to go to one.

00:08:45.480 --> 00:08:54.500
With a sparkling star as bright as you by my side, even the din of the ball will transform into a beautiful melody.

00:08:57.170 --> 00:09:00.120
We shall go, Mademoiselle.

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:03.950
Yes.

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.680
What is it, Lein?

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:10.610
Have you brought yet another plan to upgrade the Jinx?

00:09:10.670 --> 00:09:11.870
Don't be stupid!

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:14.440
Then, what do you want?

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:16.740
You need to reevaluate Operation Jinx this instant!

00:09:18.380 --> 00:09:20.500
So that's why you've come?

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:23.140
You must have noticed!

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:25.880
I've looked into it myself!

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:28.490
The Jinx is starting to falter.

00:09:28.660 --> 00:09:33.980
And you know why? The Thanatos are growing stronger in response to the Jinx's attacks!

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:40.340
Even if you find an antidote, the disease will eventually overcome it.

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:42.310
It's the same thing.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:47.550
That doesn't matter.

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:54.700
When a powerful Thanatos appears, we can simply respond with more Jinx.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:56.770
Is that what Elenfriet says?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:01.510
There's no guarantee that will work!

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:14.380
Lein...

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:16.720
Come back to the Foundation.

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:23.750
If you take the helm, I'll agree to a reevaluate the plan.

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:28.710
I'd like to have someone as skilled as yourself on board.

00:10:33.470 --> 00:10:37.140
Until then, you have no say in the matter.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:53.090
Director Yorgo... you have me!

00:10:54.390 --> 00:10:57.570
You have me!

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:18.310
Come, let us go, Mademoiselle.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:22.850
What's wrong?

00:11:22.890 --> 00:11:27.610
No... I just feel a little out of place.

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:37.520
Chin up, Angelique.

00:11:38.100 --> 00:11:41.970
To me, you sparkle more than anyone else.

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:44.350
Nyx...

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.240
This way.

00:11:48.070 --> 00:11:52.000
I've prepared a spell to take away your anxieties.

00:12:01.230 --> 00:12:03.260
It's Sir Nyx!

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.560
Sir Nyx?

00:12:04.920 --> 00:12:07.330
I've never worn a dress this beautiful before.

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:09.870
Thank you, Nyx!

00:12:10.190 --> 00:12:11.700
It looks stunning on you.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:13.820
Sir Nyx...

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:19.250
I've been waiting so long to meet you!

00:12:19.320 --> 00:12:26.870
It can't be helped. Sir Nyx is very busy, both as director of the Academy and as an Orb Hunter.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:31.140
I'm honored to see you today, Madam.

00:12:32.130 --> 00:12:34.150
Oh, Sir Nyx!

00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:35.630
It's been such a long time.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:36.940
Sir Nyx!

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:39.740
He's got a lot of acquaintances, doesn't it?

00:12:43.270 --> 00:12:45.280
Seems like he's having trouble.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:50.760
I've heard rumors of your heroic actions.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:53.050
I haven't done anything...

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:54.170
Nyx.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.010
It's almost time.

00:12:56.100 --> 00:12:57.160
What do you want?

00:12:57.190 --> 00:12:58.490
Who's this?

00:12:58.780 --> 00:13:00.080
Just who are you...

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.720
to Sir Nyx?

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:03.720
Um...

00:13:06.160 --> 00:13:07.260
Nyx...

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.350
Excuse me.

00:13:08.850 --> 00:13:11.100
My fiancé is waiting for me.

00:13:13.520 --> 00:13:14.780
No...

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.240
Sir Nyx!

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:17.760
Good evening.

00:13:25.340 --> 00:13:27.190
I'm apologize profusely.

00:13:28.320 --> 00:13:31.070
You're caught up in my made-up fantasy now, aren't you?

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:33.590
Don't worry about it.

00:13:34.130 --> 00:13:41.620
Of course, if you were my fiancée, it would bring me no greater happiness.

00:13:43.700 --> 00:13:45.000
{?}

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:47.910
I forced you to come...

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:49.820
I'm sorry.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.770
I've caused you trouble.

00:13:53.030 --> 00:13:55.550
I'm the one who should apologize.

00:13:58.590 --> 00:14:01.780
I left you alone.

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:03.220
No...

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:07.420
Come, let us enjoy the party.

00:14:07.510 --> 00:14:08.560
{?}

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:16.070
It's like I've gone back in time. You look just like them.

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:19.840
I'm very sorry.

00:14:20.050 --> 00:14:23.650
I'm an old friend of your grandfather's.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:27.820
I heard you would be coming and decided I'd like to meet you.

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:29.980
I... see.

00:14:30.300 --> 00:14:31.790
A pleasure.

00:14:31.910 --> 00:14:33.890
I'm honored to meet you.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:41.630
When I see you, I remember how he played the piano fifty years ago.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:49.570
It was a sad song that pulled at my heartstrings...

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:56.390
My doctor made a fuss, but I'm glad I came today.

00:14:56.510 --> 00:14:59.970
I met my best friend long ago.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:05.790
I'm sure my grandfather would have been happy to hear that, Monsieur.

00:15:07.900 --> 00:15:11.660
Come, you have a beautiful girl with you.

00:15:11.810 --> 00:15:13.730
Why don't you dance?

00:15:13.770 --> 00:15:14.790
Of course.

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:38.080
Nyx... tell me why...

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:44.560
Why are your eyes so distant?

00:15:58.950 --> 00:16:01.300
Everyone, please remain calm.

00:16:02.330 --> 00:16:04.580
You're... the Queen's Egg!

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:06.850
Evacuate the room.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.200
Of course.

00:16:10.120 --> 00:16:14.470
You're wrecking the ball. I'm sure the ladies will be very displeased with you.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:19.850
Come, let us dance the rondo they call: battle!

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:34.820
Are you all right?

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:44.760
August...

00:16:47.390 --> 00:16:48.720
Get a hold of yourself!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:52.800
Nyx!

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:00.910
What?

00:17:04.890 --> 00:17:05.910
Angelique!

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:25.190
Sir August!

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:26.640
Hang on!

00:17:33.480 --> 00:17:35.070
You're leaving, aren't you?

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:39.910
Yes.

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:42.800
You're not coming back?

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:47.820
I'll never forget you, August.

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:54.340
Someday, we shall meet again.

00:17:59.860 --> 00:18:01.320
I'm so glad...

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:04.940
How are you feeling?

00:18:06.490 --> 00:18:08.770
You've returned?

00:18:14.020 --> 00:18:16.100
That's impossible...

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:20.540
I was dreaming amidst this wondrous light...

00:18:23.360 --> 00:18:26.740
Angelique, are you okay?

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.310
Don't overdo it.

00:18:28.400 --> 00:18:29.550
I'm fine.

00:18:29.740 --> 00:18:32.070
I must do what I can.

00:18:34.840 --> 00:18:38.700
Angelique, haven't you noticed yet?

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:46.070
How bright your sparkle is to me...

00:18:52.190 --> 00:18:54.200
A Thanatos at a ball?

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:57.040
They're even appearing in places like that?

00:18:57.120 --> 00:19:00.280
I'm glad you're safe, Lady Angelique.

00:19:00.380 --> 00:19:02.480
I'm sure you were looking forward to the party too.

00:19:02.730 --> 00:19:03.780
I'm fine.

00:19:03.820 --> 00:19:07.310
But I would have liked to have seen you in your dress.

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:09.490
I'm sure it was very becoming.

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:15.760
Well, I don't know if she would have been able to dance with Nyx.

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:17.350
Jeez.

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:19.410
What about me?

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:21.370
Nyx...

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:24.790
Thank you for today.

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:30.710
I forgot to give you this. I found it on the floor of the hall.

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:34.460
I must have dropped it when the Thanatos attacked me.

00:19:34.640 --> 00:19:35.730
Excuse me.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:42.060
I'm the one who should thank you, Angelique.

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:52.990
Man, that guy sure is strange sometimes.

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:56.960
But I'm sure Nyx had a good time too.

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:02.060
But today...

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:03.850
August?

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:07.820
You've returned?

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:13.660
He was strange somehow...

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:25.080
Angelique, you are holy and divine; an irreplacable flower.

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.350
But I...

00:20:32.730 --> 00:20:34.190
All units proceed.

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:41.880
Our calculations show that a large number of Thanatos will appear in this area.

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:44.230
You understand, don't you, Jet?

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:46.810
We have not been granted permission for this assignment.

00:20:46.870 --> 00:20:48.000
I don't care.

00:20:48.140 --> 00:20:51.000
I'm the one who's giving the orders.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:56.670
I'll show Director Yorgo that I'm better than Professor Lein!

00:20:56.890 --> 00:20:59.340
The Thanatos will appear in five seconds.

00:20:59.410 --> 00:21:00.630
Initating Combat Mode.

00:21:04.270 --> 00:21:05.830
Initiating combat.

00:21:08.840 --> 00:21:10.820
All units, initiate combat!

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:17.510
What?

00:21:23.510 --> 00:21:28.570
Jinx damage rate: twenty-three percent.

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:30.140
Forty-nine percent.

00:21:32.780 --> 00:21:34.310
Eight-two percent.

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:37.960
At this point, continuing the operation would be impossible.

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:40.270
All remaining units will be destroyed in approximately eight seconds.

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:42.150
Shut up!

00:21:42.240 --> 00:21:43.280
Just do it!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:45.260
Roger.

00:21:47.300 --> 00:21:48.520
Why?

00:21:49.170 --> 00:21:52.000
My Jinx should be perfect...

00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:38.160
Is Elenfriet okay?

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:40.300
He's just fine. I recovered his glasses.

00:23:40.340 --> 00:23:41.430
Just his glasses?

00:23:41.460 --> 00:23:43.650
Yes. My master is the glasses.

00:23:43.670 --> 00:23:45.300
What an amazing revelation!

00:23:45.330 --> 00:23:46.920
Next time: Dark Clouds.

00:23:46.990 --> 00:23:48.530
I never knew those glasses held such a secret...

00:23:48.550 --> 00:23:49.760
They don't.
